  "solution": "Given:\n\n(43+frac{2)/(7) of 28-7}{(72÷8×2.5)-1(1)/(8) of ((4)/(3)-(8)/(9))}\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/36648f6d9fd5d1d56959b630c72b514ab488f27d2525de3370bb428cc41cf8e9.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n(43+frac{2)/(7) of 28-7}{(72÷8×2.5)-1(1)/(8) of ((4)/(3)-(8)/(9))}\n\n⇒ (43+ 8 -7)/((72÷8×2.5)-1frac{1){8} of ((4)/(3)-(8)/(9))}\n\n⇒ (43+ 8 -7)/((9×2.5)-1frac{1){8} of ({12 - 8 over 9})}\n\n⇒ (43+ 8 -7)/((9×2.5)-{9 over 8) of {4 over 9}}\n\n⇒ (43+ 8 -7)/((9×2.5)-{1 over 2)}\n\n⇒ (43+ 8 -7)/(22.5-0.5)\n\n⇒ frac{44} {22} = 2\n\n∴ The simplified value is 2.",
